      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name} Literally anything about bugs, feature requests, problems, ideas, getting help from other creators, etc.\n\nNot every idea comes from a single person making a canny. Sometimes the canny gets put together by multiple people discussing and this would give people the space\n\nAlso actual VRChat team members could react to discussions, give information etc\n\nPrefabs is a good case of this, but it's very limited to only mainly top 1% world builders, and it's not an official server. A more open server to all levels of SDK users would be much better for the platform\n\nThe dev team could also observer how people actually use the SDK, what are their issues, etc. A lot gets lost in the silence of not seeing these things, because there is no place for people to discuss it.\n\nThe official VRChat server provides some space, but it is cluttered with non SDK stuff.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-03T12:24:44.233Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The title is pretty self explanatory.\n\nWhy do this ?\n\n- The main Discord server is good but there's so much stuff that's not related to the SDK. Lot of people there are not using it at all or just to upload avatars\n\n- If you only stick to servers like the Closed Beta, your feedback and testing is very limited. I also strongly suspect these servers are mainly consisted of friend groups and social circles.\n\n- The SDK Discord Server could be used to collect feedback from all kinds of creators, not only the top 1%. Different people use your SDK and you need to listen to more of them.\n\n- Since there is a localisation discord server and a wiki discord server, adding one more should not be a problem.\n\nVRChat said in the past they want to better their communication with their users.\n\nBetter your communication with your creators, who make your platform alive and working by having an open channel of communication using this discord server.",
